{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30809","headline":"送僧归闽中旧寺 · 马戴","name":"送僧归闽中旧寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寺隔海山遥，帆前落叶飘。\n断猨通楚塞，惊鹭出兰桡。\n星月浮波岛，烟萝渡石桥。\n钟声催野饭，秋色落寒潮。\n旧社人多老，闲房树半凋。\n空林容病士，岁晚待相招。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马戴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30809.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30809","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}